In particular without using a wish.  There are two chaotic artifact
weapons that are easy for any player to acquire in the early game
whether they are chaotic or not.  There are two lawful artifact weapons
that are easy for any player to acquire in the late phase of a marathon
game whether they are lawful or not.  I've ended up with all four in
several very long games.

There is a class of monsters who are generated with either Demonbane or
Sunsword if they do not already exist in a game.  One species has a 5%
chance of an attempt to convert it's initial weapon to one of them.  The
other species has a 100% chance of trying to convret it's initial weapon
to one of them.  In a marathon game of over preparation there's plenty
of time to spawn and kill those monsters even if they are peacefulls.


